1124 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The annual report has set out a comprehensive account of REDF\031s performance in 2025\056 This includes its contribution to the Housing Programme and its role as a central steward of the Kingdom\031s housing finance ecosystem under Vision 2030\056\n\nThe successes of 2025 were underpinned by three mutually reinforcing drivers\072 Financial ecosystem leadership\054 through deepened collaboration across the housing ecosystem\056 Implementation of the updated corporate strategy and human capital transformation\056 Institutional excellence\054 demonstrated through advanced digital transformation\054 automation\054 governance and increased data\055driven decision making\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 1125 0 R
     /Pg 1088 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1125 0 obj
  << /K [ 1124 0 R ]
     /P 1164 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 1088 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1126 0 obj
  << /ActualText (At the same time\054 the year also highlighted important challenges\056 Evolving demographic expectations\054 urbanisation pressures and the need to serve more vulnerable segments\056 These pressures reinforced the importance of closer alignment with the banking sector\054 stronger liquidity mechanisms and the need to focus on a more targeted subsidy model whilst achieving financial sustainability\056)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 1127 0 R
     /Pg 1088 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

