     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1130 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Overall\054 2025 marked a transition for REDF\054 from programme delivery to financial ecosystem leadership\054 supported by a renewed strategy and strengthened senior leadership\056 The foundations laid provide confidence that the Kingdom can not only reach its homeownership targets\054 but do so in a way that is inclusive\054 financially resilient and aligned with the aspirations of a new generation of Saudi citizens\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 1131 0 R
     /Pg 1088 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
